l},"note_id":null,"start":70,"end":89},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o071b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-82d7467044559aacb812","layer":"original","quote":"孙权闻先主住白帝，甚惧，遣使请和〖17〗。先主许之，遣太中大夫宗玮报命。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":404,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":57},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee","layer":"modern","quote":"〖7〗二年：章武二年（公元 222）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":413,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-18295fa1c5ff11c612db","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o068","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8136daaf302c35b9c188","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖7〗，先主军还秭归；将军吴班、陈式水军屯夷陵，夹江东西岸〖8〗。二月，先主自秭归率诸将进军，缘山截岭，于夷道猇亭﹝二﹞驻营〖9〗。自佷山﹝三﹞通武陵〖10〗，遣侍中马良安慰五溪蛮夷〖11〗，咸相率响应。镇北将军黄权督江北诸军，与吴军相拒于夷陵道。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
